  "text": "SYNTHETIC TEST DOCUMENT - FICTIONAL PATIENT\nHarbor Point GI - Visit and procedure note\nPatient: Theo Marsh (fictional) | Date of service: 2026-10-30\n\nOffice visit, separate from the procedures: evaluation of new iron-deficiency anemia. Total time on the date of the visit: 32 minutes. The decision was made to proceed with endoscopy today.\n\nUpper endoscopy: The endoscope was passed to the second part of the duodenum. Biopsies were taken from the gastric antrum with cold forceps.\n\nColonoscopy: The colonoscope was advanced through the colon. A 9 mm pedunculated polyp in the sigmoid colon was removed with a hot snare and retrieved.\n\nImpression: Gastric biopsies taken; one sigmoid polyp removed.",
